                <pb facs="0848" n="728" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg728"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.113/246: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Child</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-04-15T14:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 15,
                                1922—2 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>50. Your 56 April 13, 3 A.M.</p>
                <p>Is Italian Government’s statement to be understood as meaning that deliveries
                    will not be made under contracts made either before or after joint declaration
                    made to Chinese Government May 5, 1919?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
